/**
 * Finite positive planning estimates are expectations, not physical cardinality ceilings. The input estimates are
 * deliberately reduced after normal compilation; source metadata and every data read remain real. This is an
 * estimate-uncertainty contract, not a claim that the optimizer emits these particular estimates.
 */
